### Time Saving
- Use options to eliminate
- Approximation in DI
- Learn squares up to 30, cubes up to 20
- Tables up to 25

### Mental Math
- 25% = 1/4, 50% = 1/2, 75% = 3/4
- 33.33% = 1/3, 66.67% = 2/3

## 11. PYQ Analysis

*Focus areas from recent PYQs:*
- RC passages increasing in length
- Data Interpretation sets common
- Time-Work, Percentage, Ratio frequent
- Syllogism and Puzzles regular

## 12. Practice Tests

*Full length timed practice recommended - minimum 10 tests before exam*

## 13. Revision Notes

### Must Know Formulas
- (a+b)^2 = a^2 + b^2 + 2ab
- % change = (diff/original)*100
- Profit% = (Profit/CP)*100
- Speed = Distance/Time
- Time = Work/Efficiency

