# Parliamentary Legislative Process

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Bill Introduction] --> B{Type of Bill}
    B -->|Ordinary Bill| C[First Reading]
    B -->|Money Bill| D[Lok Sabha First - Rajya Sabha only recommendations]
    C --> E[Second Reading - General discussion]
    E --> F[Committee Stage]
    F --> G[Third Reading]
    G --> H[Other House]
    H --> I{Passed in both houses?}
    I -->|Yes| J[President Assent]
    I -->|No| K[Joint Sitting Article 108 if deadlock]
    K --> J
    J --> L[Becomes Act]
```

## Notes
- Money Bill: Article 110, only Lok Sabha can introduce, Rajya Sabha 14 days
- Ordinary Bill: Can originate in either House
- Joint Sitting: Presided by Lok Sabha Speaker
EOF
